{"id":"n78874-1-7","stage":4,"title":"충혈 · 充血","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78874-1-7-1","ko":"피곤해? 눈에 충혈이 생겼어.","zh":"累吗？眼睛都充血了哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피곤해?","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈에","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"충혈이","meaning":"充血，淤血","explanation":"충혈：充血，淤血；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"충혈","audio":"/audio/e76b0c4825a41afed8ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78874","senseId":"1","lemma":"충혈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼어.","meaning":"表示造成前面所表达的不好的状况。","explanation":"생기다：表示造成前面所表达的不好的状况。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67899","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"e76b0c4825a41afe","term":"충혈","zh":"充血，淤血","audio":"/audio/e76b0c4825a41afed8ce.mp3","entryId":"78874","definition":"血液在身体的局部不正常聚集的症状。","pronunciation":["충혈"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"表示造成前面所表达的不好的状况。","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67899","definition":"表示造成前面所表达的不好的状况。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/76dfb8682128d6f25ce0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78874-1-7-2","ko":"그래? 어제 잠을 못 자서 그래.","zh":"是吗？因为昨天没睡好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자서","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/97f9b408c749d7cef776.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78874","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["累吗？眼睛都充血了哦。","是吗？因为昨天没睡好啊。","我来买件衬衫，不知道该选哪款好呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["累吗？眼睛都充血了哦。","是吗？因为昨天没睡好啊。","我来买件衬衫，不知道该选哪款好呢？"],"answer":1}]}
